<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Ecopetrol exports 4.2 mln bbls in June.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Ecopetrol exports 4.2 mln bbls in June.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's state-run oil company Ecopetrol exported 4.2 million barrels of crude worth more than $71.7 million in June, according to a statement issued Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company also exported 2.4 million barrels of non- specified oil derivatives worth a total $38.2 million.</p>
<p>In the same month Ecopetrol imported more than 734,000 barrels of gasoline at a cost of $18.8 million.</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for the first half of 1997 were unavailable.</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
